            "body": "Thanks. FYI, please don't add `Closes #37922 for release-0.12` , obviously the issue is not closed so we don't want github to auto-close it.\r\n\r\nTo be clear: #37922 is a more general bug, it's not specifically about checkhealth. But this workaround is fine for now.",
